    "text": "Use constraints: Users agree to notify the University of Alaska Museum Access constraints: Responses to routine inquires about the mammal data are provided free of charge. Written requests are required to specify the intended use of the data. User must review and sign a Data Use Policy stating data use provisions. Distribution liability: While every effort has been made to ensure that these data are accurate and reliable within the limits of the current state of the art, NOAA cannot assume liability for any damages caused by any errors or omissions in the data, nor as a result of the failure of the data to function on a particular system. NOAA makes no warranty, expressed or implied, nor does the fact of distribution constitute such a warranty."
